# Single source of truth for pinned tool + dependency versions LOCAL to this
# package. Sourced by the scripts that need them — bump in ONE place, never
# inline. Plain `KEY="value"` so it's both shell-sourceable and greppable.
#
#   source "$(dirname "$0")/versions.env"
#
# Every entry here is a pinned tool/binary specific to icu_kit's wasm build
# or its own platform gate. The GENERIC CI pins (fvm, Chrome, bore, and the
# zizmor + actionlint gate versions) live in whuppi/ci — the shared
# capabilities + reusable pr-checks carry them from whuppi/ci's own
# versions.env, so they do not live here.
# Facts about the subject being built (the icu4x fork, its base tag, its
# features, the pinned Rust nightly) live in build.json instead.
#
# Who bumps what:
#   tool/ci/upgrade.sh (daily PR) — the local pins in this file:
#       BINARYEN_*, PANA_VERSION.
#   whuppi/ci self-upgrade — the shared pins, reaching this repo through a
#       whuppi/ci release + the grouped whuppi-ci Dependabot PR.
#   the shared upgrade-check   — the Flutter SDK in .fvmrc + the lockfiles.
#   Dependabot                 — pub deps + GitHub-action SHAs.

# binaryen / wasm-opt release (compile_rust.sh --wasm-opt, used by
# tool/build_wasm.dart).
BINARYEN_VERSION="version_132"

# pana — pub.dev's own analyzer, run by the `platforms` make target + CI job to
# gate that the package still resolves to all 6 pub.dev platforms. `dart pub
# global activate` resolves it from pub.dev (own integrity), so no sha is
# tracked. Bumped by tool/ci/upgrade.sh to pub.dev's LATEST: the gate must run
# the same pana pub.dev runs, or it drifts from the verdict it exists to predict.
PANA_VERSION="0.23.18"

# ── Pinned binary downloads (verified via tool/fetch_verified.sh) ──
# sha256 values are self-computed from the release assets AND cross-checked
# against the GitHub Release API digests. Bump alongside the version.

# binaryen / wasm-opt (compile_rust.sh --wasm-opt) — matches BINARYEN_VERSION.
BINARYEN_SHA256_LINUX_X64="195ddc94f9bc89f45abdabb0b9eea86023d727ba90eac8b35b80f2544fc30572"
BINARYEN_SHA256_MACOS_ARM64="98aad827847af7ef990ed7098d885725c8e5b5aae75073403635617ae4e259aa"
BINARYEN_SHA256_WINDOWS_X64="2089428ec98c899b45ee5d00636ddd6e2da8636cc473ef50b165cc25793ef7cb"
